      English, and the default: this is the unqualified file, so any device whose
      language Kookboek does not have lands here. Dutch is in res/values-nl/strings.xml,
      and the two must stay key-for-key identical — add a string and you add it twice.

      British spelling, and the same tone as the Dutch: plain, warm, no exclamation
      marks. The app name is a Dutch word and stays one.
